const DEFAULT_EMAIL_TEMPLATES={"firstTimer": {"subject": "Welcome to House on the Rock Lagos - NPOC Invitation", "body": "Dear {{Name}},\n\nWelcome again to House on the Rock (HOTR), Lagos. We were excited to see you in church for the first time and like our Pastor mentioned, we would like to see you again. We are even more excited that you intend to join the House on the Rock.\n\nTo kick-start your integration into the HOTR family, we invite you to the New Parishioners Orientation Class (NPOC).\n\nThis class holds on Sundays at Class 1.21 first floor of the church building from 7:45 am to 8:45 am.\n\nThe class is divided into 2 modules (Module 1 and Module 2) over two weeks. You are required to attend the two classes over two consecutive Sundays.\n\nThe New Parishioners’ Orientation Class (NPOC) is deliberately designed to enable you to know the House on the Rock better.\n\nThese two classes highlight the commitment of House on the Rock to:\n- Treat the infallible Word of God with much dedication, ministering to your needs.\n- Minister to your God ordained destiny.\n- Assist you through the Word of God and covenant relationships to become all that God has called you to be and do.\n\nFinally, the course also provides you with an overview of the vision, mission and core values of House on the Rock. You get to learn about the spread of House on the Rock in Nigeria, the importance of joining a Church In The Home (CITH) centre and the various opportunities to serve in House on the Rock.\n\nFor more information about this course and others, please call the Church Office (234-1-4614120).\n\nRegards,\nRock Foundation School"}, "secondTimer": {"subject": "Invitation to Complete NPOC Module 2", "body": "Dear {{Name}},\n\nOnce again you are most welcome to House on The Rock (Home for all).\n\nThank you for attending the first module of the New Parishioners Orientation Class.\n\nWe invite you to complete the programme by attending Module 2 class after which you will successfully graduate from the programme.\n\nPlease find below the class details.\n\nDate: {{NextClassDate}}\nTime: 7:45am\nVenue: Class 1.21 - The Rock Cathedral, Lekki, Lagos\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you to class.\n\nKind regards,\nTeece Ogbu-Nnachi\nLead Admin (NPOC)"}};
